  "description": "AssemblyBlast — runtime C# class generation and assembly compilation for .NET. Build types via Reflection.Emit or compile JSON-defined assemblies via Roslyn, read existing assemblies into ClassDefinition / EnumDefinition shapes via AssemblyReader, or render those shapes back to C# source via AssemblyWriter. Sibling in the Blast family, split out of the legacy Mnemonics.CodingTools package.",
